<title>SWEDEN: Lufthansa Cargo starts 2nd Sto-Fra freighte.</title>
<headline>Lufthansa Cargo starts 2nd Sto-Fra freighte.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo said on Tuesday that it had put a second weekly Boeing 747F Jumbo freighter onto the Stockholm-Frankfurt route.</p>
<p>Lufthansa Cargo said in a statement that this was the first result of the new alliance with SAS Cargo.</p>
</text>
